{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b9ed1cbab83ee2c79ab14e6e11208cb87625ee1c0d191817476304f20dd8a95", "ja": "（まつりのステージも、終了間近。まつりの生み出す\n不思議な世界に、劇場中が魅了されている……）", "zh": "（茉莉的表演要结束了。整个剧场的人\n都为茉莉打造的神奇世界深深着迷……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "cfeb0f219322f7a138b0fc440597aaa6daca775085308f4ef9d09c6c6ee08020", "ja": "それでは最後に……森の動物さん達にも、\n盛大な拍手をお願いするのです～！", "zh": "那最后……要请森林的动物们\n献上盛大掌声了的唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1002_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "f179dd9dd5e24efc352168923eead50509ba61f411ad273ecb7d894b3ea676f3", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……。", "zh": "（掌声如雷）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "5a0d03f264e3b007a535a996ee0411ce98800db2a885ab2fd3350e1b4916f74c", "ja": "みんな、また絶対に、まつり姫とゆかいな仲間たちに\n会いにくるのです。姫との約束なのです♪", "zh": "大家一定要再来看茉莉公主和愉快的伙伴们。\n跟公主约好了的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1004_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "97cb7e43be776ae203b8ab9c743655439b751b9a7be7002df8707ddfd84c6981", "ja": "ワァ～……！", "zh": "哗啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "875bb93bae0e5f95c1dab96432b7dec8216046955e53baeedbd6c32d4a390623", "ja": "まつり、お疲れさま！", "zh": "茉莉，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "df6d4b05b7f3e881ba23d4cbcf8a9690970f3ff6ec13b6fe3da9c0f16ef12564", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\n姫たちのステージ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了唷。\n公主我们的表演如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "81bbe18276b1cc874cde816d3f9cf66cb9084a8753f9225183536c1ac6b992b2", "ja": "ああ、すごく盛り上がってたよ。\n動物の中の人達も、すごく頑張ってくれたし……。", "zh": "嗯，观众反应非常热烈喔。\n穿着动物装的人们也很努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b3abd14f5778e191cefa0748ec7cdc2e9f3f0eea3be1f3dbe163b93b1a38227", "ja": "ほ？　中の人なんていないのですよ？　動物さんは\n森からやってきた、ゆかいな仲間たちなのです♪", "zh": "哦？里面根本没有人的呀，\n那些动物都是从森林来的愉快伙伴的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "324c56d122132a63ae3e66f93d9a40bdfd2ad255ee6d1f6bff4b93594eaf6e2f", "ja": "そ、そうか？\nそれなら、心配ない、か……？", "zh": "是、是吗？\n那我就不担心了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "245e3d8d1e6138b3b7eb6a28762f43bff3d291783119669ff625f822deb16fda", "ja": "それより{$P$}さんも、\n姫の魔法のトリコになったのです？", "zh": "比起这个，{$P$}先生\n也有变成公主魔法的俘虏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "611d838b6c9712f58859a32dc088ba6285f2738f02572a3d9df1c2ca4c40ddf4", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。まつりが作るステージは、\n本当に魔法みたいな楽しさだったよ。", "zh": "嗯，有喔。茉莉的表演，\n真的就像在施展魔法一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "29531563cf9b62dce515358be2732686cb7941a9e5acebc308dbcb62e6f35f18", "ja": "それなら、よかったのです♪", "zh": "那就好的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "4ffec6958ab98e664ba17b2e07c4981c70755eb01bbcd744a77c19c565c75c05", "ja": "では今日は特別に、{$P$}さんに\n姫の魔法の秘密を教えてあげましょー！", "zh": "那今天，公主就特别把魔法的秘密\n跟{$P$}先生说吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c09a55f90fa5b4b7bd08a60f9a36f449e48279c1a7c6cc8ea0efdcfcfe852d68", "ja": "まつりの、魔法の秘密？", "zh": "茉莉魔法的秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "b75b57d4abbb07449537ae7fab4e4752aac1f2ccb5d128303de9f03d30c8d474", "ja": "そうなのです！　姫の魔法ぱわー！の源は、\nキノコさんと、森の仲間たちだけじゃないのです。", "zh": "没错！公主的魔力来源，\n可不是只有蘑菇和森林的伙伴们的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b6ea9770bea2be8f8db6563e503f7ee49540cfd193739edf15062031a9b37f1", "ja": "姫に一番力をくれるのは……\nファンのみんなの応援、なのですよ♪", "zh": "带给公主最多力量的……\n就是粉丝们的声援了唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "019e14497079498620d04ddf06988f20ccbd6bd126b6fba827672fc5882f8436", "ja": "なるほど……。\nまつりの魔法の源は、ファンのみんなだったのか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n茉莉魔法的源头，就是台下的粉丝啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "364bffc378f3417e7ee4fc0794d9700c6163fb45010088b16d2d1f87799e7fb4", "ja": "はいなのです。あとは、{$P$}さんが\n見守っていてくれること、なのです♪", "zh": "没错的喔。另外，还有{$P$}先生\n一直在旁守候茉莉的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "e8d7da1cac7eefd8d704fca03b79036d4491d152d080bf53e5c7a43d52473f80", "ja": "だから{$P$}さんは、いつも\nまつりのそばで、見ていてくれないとダメなのです！", "zh": "所以{$P$}先生要一直\n待在茉莉身边，看着茉莉才行的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "42ffd1b05b4a3104ed6d471fe6b0264734a1f2cab632b9672407fd7cb6319742", "ja": "ファンのみんなはともかく、まつりは\n俺がいなくても、魔法が使えるんじゃないか？", "zh": "先不论粉丝他们，就算没有我在，\n茉莉还是能使用魔法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b495e9eddee926a87174a3ef8f7a8ab31eda279e21ea78a52fe3dc2a3f2b2f93", "ja": "まつりに、最初に魔法をかけられたのは俺だからな。\n最初の魔法は、まつりが使ったんだ。", "zh": "因为头一个被茉莉施展魔法的人就是我呀，\n茉莉当初就用了第一个魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5d4950e48d3a1f200bfe9de0757f9dd555c9b832f093f0089789db9bd486ffc0", "ja": "だから俺がいなくても、まつりは魔法が使える。\n俺はまつりが魔法を使う、手伝いをしてるだけだよ。", "zh": "所以就算我不在，茉莉也能使用魔法。\n我现在就只是在帮忙茉莉施展魔法而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "fd5ba153f48ed2d6a5bbddcee5bad2197f52adc15b2c70a6dd556d949743f002", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、ずるいのです。\n本当に、油断もスキもないのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生真是狡猾的呀。\n让人一点也不能放松戒心的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e2c5cea103a3bd0f89b403d6d05e309f418cc5c6cf4d0fe2e85e4bb44781273", "ja": "でも……そんなあなただから、\n私は信用しちゃうのかもしれないんだけど。", "zh": "不过……或许正因为你是这样，\n我才会信任你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0084_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "d33ef51057ec0c2d9eadb46d8cd0a406b55a5eae4193576736fbf32bb24c6be5", "ja": "さぁ、タネ明かしの時間はおしまいなのです！\nまた次のステージに向けて、がんばりましょー！", "zh": "好了，公布手法的时间就到这边！\n让公主我们朝下个舞台继续加油吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
